  "description": "Yiram is a half-breed vampire. Which sounds pretty mysterious and grand, but it’s nothing glamorous. He’s a fairly regular guy working as a middle school art teacher, and he doesn’t even drink blood. Mostly because he has a teeny tiny trauma regarding blood, but that’s not important. Hardly memorable…until Hong Jua, the very root of that trauma, becomes his coworker. There’s no way this can go wrong, right? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes 4 side story chapters.*",
